WEBVTT

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.340
You must be Klein.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:06.680
That's right.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.180
This is a rare sight.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.460
I heard that you're fair skinned,

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.140
but I never imagined you'd be so beautiful.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.730
You have received an official pardon.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:17.850
If you choose to do so, you are free to live on Hecate.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.940
First you must go to Hecate and complete
the necessary registration.

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:29.260
Let's go.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.530
There's that sound again.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.640
<i>Why is it...</i>

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:17.300
<i>I've been looking forward to this moment for so long.</i>

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.130
<i>Why is it that now I hear this voice saying "Don't go"?</i>

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:32.310
Amazing...

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:34.750
It's space! Space!

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:36.640
We're still maintaining gravity though.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:40.640
This is the top portion the Dagger Pagoda orbital elevator:

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.480
Chimera's space port.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:44.250
Thor, over there...

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.120
Is that huge thing a space ship?

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:48.660
An escort ship.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:53.880
The bridge is at the front. You'll be able to board Asgard there.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.570
Yes. That's Odin's space ship.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.070
From here on in, allow me to escort you.

00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:01.870
Yes.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:04.010
Who's that?

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:09.250
I'm Ion II's head researcher, Don Loki.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:10.580
Ion II?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.860
Is that the research institute on Hecate?

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.600
It is. Your mother, Eva, was also involved in Ion II's research.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.490
You certainly do look exactly like Eva.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:24.540
No wonder; it's the miracle of DNA.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:25.410
What do you mean?

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:28.500
Just what kind of research is going on in Ion II?

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.330
Let's talk about this when we get to Asgard.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:36.560
The man who has been anticipating your arrival more
than anyone, he's the one you should ask...

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.930
Now, follow me quickly.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.700
Professor Loki, thank you for your trouble.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:01.680
His Excellency is...?

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.560
He's waiting for you. Please go ahead.

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:11.780
From here on, only Thor Klein may proceed.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.290
You two can rest in the cabin lounge.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:16.390
What is this?!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:17.940
Thor...

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.980
It's alright. Don't worry,

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.000
I'll be back soon.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.040
This way, Thor.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.850
Lieutenant, please take the lady to the cabin lounge.

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:41.520
Yes!

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.650
Wait!

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.770
Why only me?! What about Third?!

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:46.400
I'd like a word with him.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:47.530
A word?

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.060
I believe congratulations are in order.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.240
After this, you'll be elevated three ranks at least.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.270
Lieutenant Sigurd Heiza.

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.080
I'm honoured, Captain Heimdall.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:06.700
Eva was always telling me how much she loved you.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.730
Yes, more than anyone or anything...

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:20.980
Our first reunion in five years, isn't it,

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:23.560
Thor Klein.

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:25.190
Odin...

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:29.780
Do you hate me?

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.060
It's fine if you kill me,

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.570
as long as my last wish is fulfilled.

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:37.740
Why did you kill them?! For what purpose?

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:41.840
Father was your right hand man, wasn't he? Why did you-

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.830
So beautiful... It moves my heart.

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:47.620
You truly are the <i>"Last Child".</i>

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.710
The triumph of genetic perfection that will save humanity.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.690
In another 50 years,

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.450
all human life in the Balkan System will be extinct.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.640
Extinct?

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:08.900
The Ion Laboratory has reached this undeniable conclusion.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:11.030
These last one hundred years,

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:15.040
only one natural childbirth has occurred in the Balkan System.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.410
We have had to use artificial fertilization to produce children,

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.950
which develop in artificial wombs.

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:29.080
Those descended from the humans of Earth
can't adapt to survive in this system

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:33.260
We must create humans of Balkan,
which will be able to survive here.

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:34.660
Create?

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:37.270
Yes, we need to create

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:41.930
humans native to the Balkan system, in order
for the population to flourish here.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:45.180
Chimera isn't a planet of capital punishment, is it?

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:50.350
Chimera is the only planet in the Balkan system
which hasn't been terraformed and colonized.

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:54.440
Why is it that on that planet the population
continues to thrive and expand?

00:06:55.070 --> 00:07:00.440
That's why we decided to collect DNA samples from Chimera.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:04.260
Then, what Zagi saw... those frozen Jyu Ohs...

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.190
those were...

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.330
They're in cold sleep.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:14.300
Jyu Oh's are important live samples which
have survived in that cruel environment.

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.660
We extract their genetic material and crossbreed them,

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.880
then send the offspring produced back to Chimera.

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.280
Then that so-called amnesty is just a lie, isn't it!

00:07:21.550 --> 00:07:22.350
Thor.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:26.870
You're doing all this for the sake of obtaining
your samples, isn't that right!!!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:27.770
Stop it!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:34.440
We... we... are only guinea pigs, aren't we!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.650
Stop! Stop or we'll shoot!

00:07:37.980 --> 00:07:40.360
Idiot! Don't point that gun at him!

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:41.490
That's right!

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.830
You must protect him at all costs!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.560
He is the <i>"Last Child".</i>

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:54.260
The product of non-stop replicated testing over the past
hundreds years; the pinnacle of DNA perfection.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:57.030
Now, hurry up and put those guns away.

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:57.970
Yes!

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:09.270
Eva was the only successful surrogate
mother of an artificial embryo.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.810
She was involved in the experiment as a researcher,
and gave birth to you naturally.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.530
The Kleins were really nothing more than strangers to you.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:20.400
The child which you believed to be your twin brother

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.010
is their real son, conceived through artificial fertilization.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:26.700
The two of you were not related by blood at all.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.920
Then, why did we look like, the two of us?

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.330
That's your power.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:39.720
The power of DNA wanting to survive no matter what,

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.640
ensuring you would grow up under any circumstances;

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:45.850
it even simulated your mother's appearance.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.210
Even though she understood all of this,

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.690
Eva still chose to love you.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:09:02.560
The final test was to prove that you
could survive in a cruel environment,

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:08.150
but when the time came to send you to Chimera, Eva refused.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:13.780
As result, we were left with no choice
but to take extreme measures.

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:22.290
The one... the one I really want to kill...

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:24.590
...is myself.

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:29.440
In the short time we have left,

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:32.160
we must increase the population by any means.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:37.590
This being the case, the DNA of the
<i>"Invincible Child"</i> is indispensable.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:39.580
Go ahead.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.410
Do whatever you want.

00:09:44.210 --> 00:09:46.560
Carve up my body into an unrecognizable mess.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.760
Brain, limbs; they're all yours!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:51.770
You made them after all!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.310
Chimera made them.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.570
Even if we're banded devils, we have no other choice.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:02.280
As of now, we don't have any time left.

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:06.320
Rather than doing this and creating humans adapted to Balkan,

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.410
why not go back to Earth?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:12.400
Excuse me.

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:23.020
Sigurd Heiza, reporting.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.050
Allow me to introduce

00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:33.370
Lieutenant Sigurd Heiza. You know him as the man named Third.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:38.400
As part of my duty, I was previously required
to change my skin and hair colour.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:46.590
He is involved in the Midgard plan: the
project to produce humans of Balkan.

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:52.660
He infiltrated in Chimera ahead of you,
and helped you become Jyu Oh.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:56.340
As expected, you had this planned all along.

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:01.660
Keeping you alive and allowing you to
become Jyu Oh within ten years;

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:05.480
this was the scenario we had planned.

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:08.010
So the one who killed Karin was you?!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.300
It was my duty.

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:13.770
Third, you bastard!

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:17.190
The person called Third never existed.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:24.820
Don't touch me!

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:30.850
All this time, what is it that I've been fighting for?

00:11:31.810 --> 00:11:33.740
This so-called <i>"Invincible Child"...</i>

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:37.420
This body which barely survived...

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.570
I beg you... please, kill me.

00:11:52.950 --> 00:11:53.880
Odin, Your Excellency.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:56.950
I'd like to thank you once again,

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.620
Lieutenant Sigurd Heiza.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.330
There's no need for that, Your Excellency.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:08.040
About your request to join delegation visiting Earth;

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:08.770
Yes.

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:12.470
as promised, your name will be added to that list.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.130
You can go to earth.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.190
<i>When was the first I saw the Earth?</i>

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.950
<i>It was only a holograph,</i>

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.700
<i>but even so, it still looked like a blue jewel.</i>

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:45.900
<i>That was the first beautiful thing I ever saw.</i>

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:54.120
<i>That place seemed so far away from my own world.</i>

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.840
<i>That's why I'm looking forward to it so much.</i>

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.340
<i>To get there, I'm willing to do anything,</i>

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:04.190
<i>give up anything.</i>

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.180
<i>That is my only wish.</i>

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:15.640
Thor!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.160
What's wrong? What did they do to you?!

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:19.120
Thor!

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.710
From now on he'll be helping us continue with the experiment.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:24.610
Get out! I said get out!

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:27.660
I'll come for you later.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:34.210
What's wrong?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.920
Everything I know is a lie

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.130
Jyu Oh, and Third too...

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:42.550
even my own existence was planned.

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:47.510
Dad, Mom and Rai; I killed them.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:48.930
Thor...

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.190
But even though that's how it was,

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.340
I've been struggling to survive all this time.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.220
I don't really understand, but

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.220
your Dad and Mom

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:03.530
would have wanted you to live, no matter what happened.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.090
Don't you think that's what they would have wanted?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.200
It's the same for me.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.990
I love Thor,

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.370
so I want the person I love to live happily.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:15.540
It doesn't matter if you were artificially created or whatever,

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.790
I want to bare your child.

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:20.500
But you're still hurting,

00:14:21.410 --> 00:14:23.830
so it'd be good if I could understand even just a bit more.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.180
I... I'm so useless. I'm sorry.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:37.050
Thor...

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:42.060
Let's go back; go back to Chimera.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.840
When we get back, we'll have a child.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.280
Thor is...?

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:55.450
In the cabin.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:15:00.800
As we planned, extract Thor Klein's DNA right away.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.040
Begin the generation of Balkan humans,

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:07.620
and then accelerate Chimera's self-rotation rate.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:09.410
After we change the environment,

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.630
the progeny that inherit his DNA will be reared there.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.260
Do you want to create more victims?

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:17.640
We don't have any time left.

00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:18.630
I know!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.780
But if we accelerate it's self-rotation rate,

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:23.720
most of the people living on Chimaera will die!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.640
We already have the <i>"Last Child"</i> in our hands!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.980
All we need to do now is slowly reproduce humans, right?!

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:33.730
Within my lifetime...

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:38.590
I want to see the result of this project while I'm still alive.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.780
This is my wish.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.830
Professor Loki, even you;

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.910
If you obstruct this plan, you will be dealt with as well.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.170
You would go that far!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.100
I'll kill you right now!!!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.250
Stop this! What are you thinking?!

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.210
Enough is enough.

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:00.860
We've been playing God for too long.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.870
I can't take it anymore!

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.380
W... why?

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.020
Odin, Your Excellency!

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:17.940
I'll be fine.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:21.070
Professor, explain this!

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:22.410
What's going on here?!

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.620
Captain, quickly, call a medic!

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.030
It's fine.

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:28.370
But your wound?!

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:30.400
I said it's fine.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:33.920
There's no time left.

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:50.020
What's that?

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.480
Self-rotation Acceleration System standby.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:58.320
Ball launch countdown start.

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.240
Thor, what's starting?

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:02.410
I don't know.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:03.910
Anyway, let's go and look.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.080
You guys!

00:17:08.430 --> 00:17:09.200
Third!

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.320
What was that sound just now?

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:14.290
It seems someone started the Self-rotation
Acceleration System.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.290
Let's go!

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:17.960
What's the Self-rotation Acceleration System?

00:17:18.320 --> 00:17:20.450
It's the final phase of the Midgard plan.

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:22.590
It'll change Chimera's entire environment.

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:23.880
Why would they do that?

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:27.260
In order to rear the children who inherit your DNA.

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:29.510
Currently Chimera's environment is too harsh,

00:17:30.240 --> 00:17:31.580
so they'll accelerate the self-rotation rate to change it;

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:32.840
that's why the system was created.

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:37.440
The system components are buried underground
in several places on Chimera.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:40.520
If it starts, what will happen to Chimera?

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:44.060
After three minutes, the system buried
underground will release the Ball.

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.860
When the Ball reaches Chimera's core,

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.520
it will cause a massive earthquake across the planet.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:52.120
Volcanos will erupt after that;

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.190
the structure of the continents will change too.

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:58.500
And what's going to happen to all the people?!!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:10.430
Professor Loki!

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:14.710
This is all because we were trying to forcibly execute the plan...

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.310
What did you do?

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:22.210
Hey, answer me!

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:23.160
Stop, Thor!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.320
I said answer me!!!

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:24.900
Let go of him!

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:26.070
Tell me,

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:28.200
how can we stop the Self-rotation Acceleration System?

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:34.330
I won't let anyone stand in the way of my wish for humanity.

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:37.560
Third!

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:40.220
If you know, please tell me;

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:42.500
tell me how to stop the acceleration system.

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:45.160
Hey, Third!

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:46.480
Valkyrie.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.970
It controls that Ball.

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:53.430
From here there's no way we can directly
access Valkyrie to stop it's activity.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.030
You have to go to Hecate

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:58.450
and enter the abort code into Valkyrie's main system.

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:02.420
How long will it take for the Self-rotation Acceleration
System to activate completely?

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.410
About 2 hours.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:10.350
I'm going to Hecate. You're coming too.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.280
You're my Third... aren't you.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:16.710
I don't obey your orders,

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:23.460
but it's my duty to prevent premature
activation of the final phase.

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:29.510
Tiz, go back to Chimera.

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:32.550
Do your best to get everyone to the orbital elevator.

00:19:32.970 --> 00:19:33.720
Thor...

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:35.680
Take care of it.

00:19:39.140 --> 00:19:39.810
Got it!

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.080
Tiz, don't get yourself killed.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.930
I'm not the kind of person who'd leave her Top and die so easily.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:52.120
Thor, make sure you keep your promise, okay.

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:56.890
Yeah. Survive, and then again...

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:06.510
Let's go.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.220
Before the Ball launches, how much time do we have?

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:11.330
10 seconds.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:26.370
5

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:27.320
4

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:28.410
3

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:29.410
2

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:30.570
1

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:52.720
What's going on?

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:57.390
Thor, do you know anything about this?
